{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0218056/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"notロマンス\nyes浪漫！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヲタ芸もいいけど\n今日は浪漫の日だよ＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわさび(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きのうの夜\nトイ・ストーリー2やってたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「れいかってウッディに似てるね！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「なんで知ってるの？前言われてた。おじいちゃんはバズに似てるの」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お、おう(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フリコピのコツは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nコツとか特になくて普通に\n見ててだんだんフリ入ってきたら\n見ながら踊るだけだけど\n中田は今はライブとか行けないから\nテレビでヨリでうつしてる部分は\n足の動きとかがわかんないから\n他の番組でやったやつも見るとかしてるよ〜\nいい答えじゃなくてごめんね(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甚平は着る？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n着たことないや(´・ω・`)\n着やすそうだよね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験生のときの夏休みは\n一日何時間くらい勉強した？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n何回か書いてるけど\n中田の行ってた高校は\n中学からエスカレーターの学校で\n高校受験してないから\n受験は中学受験のときの話になるけど\n小学生の頃とかもう記憶にないから\nわからん(´・ω・`)ごめんね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪に効くものは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nサラダうどんと野菜ジュースじゃない？(・∀・)\nとりま野菜。\n中田とか野菜DD(not男子大学生)なんで(￣∇￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サラダうどん頼むときのサイズは？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n半日分の小！\nこれでも十分お腹いっぱいになるから\nすごいよね＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家での一人称は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n「うち」かなー\n花奈のときもあるかも？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、今日の乃木坂浪漫は\n中田みたいです(゜ロ゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビ東京\n24:53〜24:58"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『太陽のない街』徳永直"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はカンパネルラ的な伝説がうまれるか！？\nいや、もうカンパネルラとは呼ばせない！？\n滑舌最悪中田の奇跡の乃木坂浪漫3回目！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑これ新聞の見出しに欲しいね(・∀・)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張ったので\nもしお時間よろしければ\n見てください(*・ω・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の副業の寝顔ハンターだよん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nきのう浪漫やってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんの寝顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/0218056/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣ver.（￣＾￣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よっしゃ中田GJ(￣∇￣)ｂそれな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい(((。-ω-)zzZ. . ."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あ、まった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと浪漫見てから寝よっか(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}